### Pre-existing integration-branch repairs required to make the gate runnable (documented per Honesty Covenant #9)
This auto-integration branch HEAD did not build before this change, for reasons unrelated to the surface:
1. apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj was corrupt — two concatenated <Project>
   roots (MSB "multiple root elements"), 332 duplicate <Compile> items, and 4 <!-- comment openers lost
   (a bare '&' in "Energy & Activity" broke XML parse). Repaired in place: collapsed to one root (folding
   SummarySlide.Model.cs, the sole link unique to the duplicate root), de-duplicated Compile items
   (382 unique), restored the comment openers, normalized to LF. No test coverage dropped.
2. YearReviewDriveHighlight was defined twice in namespace TeslaSync.App.FeatureViews.Review
   (DriveHighlightSlide.Model.cs AND SlideRenderer.Model.cs, incompatible shapes) -> the app glob co-compiled
   both -> whole solution red. Resolved with a behavior-preserving rename of SlideRenderer's forwarding copy
   to SlideDriveHighlight (its own doc defers the canonical model to DriveHighlightSlide). Confined to
   SlideRenderer.Model.cs + SlideRendererTests.cs; no assertion/behavior change.

### Surface deliverable (feature-views/WeekOverWeekSummary/)
WeekOverWeekSummary.Model.cs / .Source.cs / .ViewModel.cs / .cs + Tests/FeatureViews/WeekOverWeekSummaryTests.cs
(40 test cases). Parity port of web WeekOverWeekSummary.tsx: FadeIn+GlassPanel chrome, titled responsive
6-card grid (Distance/Drives/Energy/Cost/Efficiency/CO2 Saved) with week-over-week trend chips (web trendFor
ported exactly), CO2 derived (energy_kwh * 0.21), metric units verbatim (web hardcodes them; no useUnits),
currency via active symbol. Full native state matrix: loading / loaded / empty / error / stale / offline.
Data via GET /vehicles/{vehicleID}/weekly-digest through the shared cache-then-network engine (no HTTP in the
view). All 7 source i18n keys resolve in Strings/*/Resources.resw (translation.analytics.weeklyDigest.*).
Narrator names on every card; reduce-motion honoured via TsFadeIn; view.opened slug=WeekOverWeekSummary.

